    - target: {fileID: 1253161411824071964, guid: 50fe8fa53408c3d45b668daabee7b142, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\u2022 Transporting station is primarily concentrates on pneumatic
        rotary axis and how to control it, in addition to a pneumatic linear axis
        for sample transfer is being used to transfer the sample.\r\n\r\n\u2022 This
        system consists of a wide variety of components including: pneumatic Rotary
        Actuator, contact-less sensors and more Industrial handling components.\r\n\r\n\u2022
        A vacuum gripper is used to hold the work piece during the operation of the
        rotary actuator.\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
